    "repair": "no switching: the VLA runs every chunk; a shared-control law edits each executed env step: u = (1 - a) u_VLA + a u_servo with a = 0 until the graspable-envelope gate blocks a closure (CLOSE commanded while neither the target (extent-based envelope) nor any other movable object (strict 0.07 m envelope) sits between the fingers: physical evidence of a phantom grasp); then a = 0.7 for 60 steps pulling the end effector above the nearest unsatisfied object; in hand the policy keeps authority unless the carry stalls 120 steps (pull toward the place point); OPEN executes only inside the goal region",
